{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms","id":854627,"title":"Which Ability to put these Sidereal Charms?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-28T13:14:37-07:00","id":854627,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Which Ability to put these Sidereal Charms?","content":"Yes, yes. I know Sidereals have a closed charm set, but since the Ex3 Sidereal book is a long time coming, I'm going to brainstorm some charms. I got a few charms in mind, but having trouble figuring out which ability to put them. With the Sidereal Charm set, the first ability that comes to mind isn't really the right answer.<br /> <br /> <b>Atmospheric Analysis Deliberation</b><br /> <br /> <i>This feels like a Secrets Charm, but the Serenity abilities seem to fit best. Linguistics? Socialize? Lore? Survival due to the &quot;talking about the weather&quot; aspect?</i><br /> <br /> Sometimes a Sidereal need to relay information to an individual without the rest of listeners knowing. The Sidereal must initiate physical contact, like a hug or a handshake, to activate the charm on an individual. Then the Sidereal can start discussion about an innocuous topic, like the weather or gardening. The target of the charm will understand the Sidereal\u2019s words as a metaphor for a topic of the Sidereal\u2019s choice.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Alternate Destiny Accommodation</b><br /> <br /> <i>Should probably be a Journey\u2019s ability, but this charm fits none of their Ex2 abilities. Occult? Bureaucracy?</i><br /> <br /> It is not easy for even a Sidereal to be in two places at once. This charm allows a Sidereal to loan one of her inactive Resplendent Destinies to another Sidereal. The Sidereal with the loaned destiny can don the destiny as usual, but is unable to use any of its resplendency powers. (may add something about increase paradox, but who knows what is going to happen with paradox in Ex3?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-28-2016, 04:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T13:18:34-07:00","id":854630,"title":"","content":"AAD in Stealth and ADA in Presence","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9258-col","name":"CoL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T13:45:30-07:00","id":854640,"title":"","content":"*locks on 1E/2E goggles*<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Atmospheric Analysis Deliberation</b> </div> </div> </div><br /> This Charm creates a bond between two people which facilitates their capacity to communicate with each other, which fits both the themes of the Linguistics Ability and its corresponding Scripture. Easy call. You can set its minimums below whatever the required Linguistics for all Sidereals is, so that Chosen of Secrets can get easy access to it. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Alternate Destiny Accommodation</b> </div> </div> </div>Ride, although it would probably need to impose some sort of control or restraint on the recipient to make thematic sense<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T14:28:08-07:00","id":854669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=854640#post854640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*locks on 1E/2E goggles*<br /> <br /> [/B]<br /> This Charm creates a bond between two people which facilitates their capacity to communicate with each other, which fits both the themes of the Linguistics Ability and its corresponding Scripture. Easy call. You can set its minimums below whatever the required Linguistics for all Sidereals is, so that Chosen of Secrets can get easy access to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome! I probably need to refer to the scriptures when I make more Sidereal Charms.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=854640#post854640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ride, although it would probably need to impose some sort of control or restraint on the recipient to make thematic sense</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm... Maybe add something to the charm limiting the destiny's use to a interacting with a single individual or group of individuals.<br /> <br /> <b>Alternate Destiny Accommodation</b><br /> <br /> It is not easy for even a Sidereal to be in two places at once. This charm allows a Sidereal to loan one of her inactive Resplendent Destinies to another Sidereal. The Sidereal with the loaned destiny can don the destiny only in the presence of an individual, social group, or location as defined by the destiny's owner. The recipient of the Destiny is unable to use any of its resplendency powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T19:19:24-07:00","id":854814,"title":"","content":"I agree, AAD is a perfect fit for Linguistics. ADA feels like it could slot in with Gift of a Broken Mask, maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T19:36:49-07:00","id":854824,"title":"","content":"I've been reading though the Maiden Scriptures and now I am reconsidering what ability this charm matches. The Scripture of the Savory Maiden (Larceny) seems to fit better since it talks about serving the world. I also doubt the Sidereal acquired the location, supplies, and resources to start the business via legal means. <br /> <br /> <b>Pho Cart Methodology</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>5 Motes, 1 WP;<b> Mins:</b> Bureaucracy 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Seven Days<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> The Sidereal can set up a small established business in a town. This Business will neither make or lose money. Residents will patron the business as if it was always there. At the end of the charm's duration, the business will vanish and the town's inhabitants will not remember its existence.<br /> <br /> <b>Essence 4+</b>: The duration of the business is extended to the end of the current story line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-28-2016, 10:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T20:10:59-07:00","id":855455,"title":"","content":"What is it for? Does the Sidereal get Resources out of it if it doesn't make any money? Or is it just to serve as a handy listening post? Either way, I think Bureaucracy is an okay fit, but Stealth could work too, as an extension off Gift of a Broken Mask. Do the noodles really exist if they shop you bought them from was never actually there? If so, why am I still full?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T06:58:34-07:00","id":855664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=855455#post855455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is it for? Does the Sidereal get Resources out of it if it doesn't make any money? Or is it just to serve as a handy listening post? Either way, I think Bureaucracy is an okay fit, but Stealth could work too, as an extension off Gift of a Broken Mask. Do the noodles really exist if they shop you bought them from was never actually there? If so, why am I still full?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's a way for Sidereal to create a popup version of a &quot;convenient&quot; teahouse for the party to meet up in. Or be that wise noodle seller who happened to hear some information to pass along. A Sidereal might not have the time to put the effort into maintaining the business, so they fudge things with fate to create a temporary one. Basically this charm is a way to flesh out a short term Resplendent Destiny a bit more. <br /> <br /> I made it profit loss even out to minimize the impact on Fate. It doesn't have to be a Pho Cart, it can be any business.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T08:37:42-07:00","id":855711,"title":"","content":"The first charm listed sounds like lingusitics. It's making a bond and deals with communication. The second feels like larceny to me, as it mostly deals with shuffling of abstract things. The third is weird, since it does very little. Generalize it a bit to people forgetting something you've set up (or said or done even) and it'd start to fit into Dodge or maybe Stealth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T08:48:49-07:00","id":855718,"title":"","content":"The Pho Cart Methodology is less the forgetting the business afterwards and more the quick set up of an established business. Through use of this charm, Fate will arrange for the Business to have patrons and maybe? employees. If someone asks about the business, a local will be able to tell that person about it. No need to advertise or fiddle around with paperwork or hire vendors for supplies. It's basically the Respledent Destiny version of a business. Yes, a Sidereal can spend some time actually doing the footwork to create a business, but that takes time to setup and build a reputation. Sidereals don't have Speed the Wheels or anything. So this charm allows them spend some motes and willpower and bam! - they have a business.<br /> <br /> Probably should edit the charm to make that clear or add &quot;develop a business plan on a prayer scroll&quot; to the charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-30-2016, 11:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T10:13:59-07:00","id":855766,"title":"","content":"In hindsight, I am wondering if Pho Cart Methodology is like Clear Water Prana. It saves the character time, but from the player perspective, there is no time difference between the charm and a Bureaucracy roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T11:21:09-07:00","id":855824,"title":"","content":"Well it really depends the intent of what you want pho cart to do. How much supernatural stuff comes into play more specifically, if someone investigates your faux business is it obvious or does a roll-off need to occur? Do you want a legitimate paper trail through a resplendent destiny reinforcing both authenticities or is this more of a paper tiger thing but dirt cheap and more importantly spammable?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T11:34:11-07:00","id":855839,"title":"","content":"My idea situation is this:<br /> <br /> Solar: I look around. Does this business look legit? *rolls dice*<br /> ST: This business is totally legit.<br /> Solar: What about that wet paint?<br /> ST: *shrugs* They remodeled recently.<br /> <br /> The business probably should be connected to a RD, so it can take advantage of the -3 dice modifier. Either way, I need to do a lot more thinking about that charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-30-2016, 02:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T11:59:08-07:00","id":855857,"title":"","content":"Welcome to game design, it's easy to make the broad concept, but you can spend forever agonizing about details only you would notice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T12:42:16-07:00","id":855895,"title":"","content":"Hmm, if it's more about the business, then you can easily just drop it in Bureaucracy. Every sideral ability supports having &quot;generic&quot; fate-meddling charms that otherwise don't fit that ability's specific theme. You can find examples of that all over the place in their charmset.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T13:12:59-07:00","id":855927,"title":"","content":"If you put it at Bureaucracy 2 then every Sidereal has access to it, which would probably make it much more commonly used (and justify it being ubiquitous among Sidereal NPCs).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5376-atg","name":"AtG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5376_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"691"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T13:49:59-07:00","id":855967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Limited Reagent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=855895#post855895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm, if it's more about the business, then you can easily just drop it in Bureaucracy. Every sideral ability supports having &quot;generic&quot; fate-meddling charms that otherwise don't fit that ability's specific theme. You can find examples of that all over the place in their charmset.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I just realized that you are the one who wrote the &quot;Always Coming Home&quot; Sidereal Linguistics Charm. I love that charm! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T14:14:25-07:00","id":855991,"title":"","content":"Hope no one minds if I turn this into my personal &quot;Sidereal Charms&quot; thread. This Asshole Sidereal charm is great for when you need a patsy.<br /> <br /> <b>Fox Goes to Ground</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>5 Motes, 1 WP;<b> Mins:</b> Thrown 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>Psyche<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Until the last star fades from the morning sky<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> The Sidereal pricks herself and smears her blood somewhere on the target's skin*. The Sidereal's current Resplendent Destiny is thrown over the target and the target is filled with terror and will flee until the Stars disappear the next morning or the target is caught or killed. If detained and questioned, the target says nothing except gibbering mutters of fear. As the last star fades from the sky, the Resplendent Destiny will revert back to the Sidereal's control. The target remembers nothing of the past day except vague feelings of terror. Death of the target will end the Sidereal's Resplendent Destiny.<br /> <br /> *maybe make this a ranged effect? Drop blood on your thrown weapon like Pain-Amplification Stratagem?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-30-2016, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T14:31:19-07:00","id":856011,"title":"","content":"Cleaned up the first two charms.<br /> <br /> <b>Atmospheric Analysis Deliberation</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>3 Motes<b> Mins:</b> Linguistics 2, Essence 1; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> End of Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>Blue Vervain Binding<br /> <br /> Sometimes a Sidereal need to relay information to an individual without the rest of listeners knowing. The Sidereal must initiate physical contact, like a hug or a handshake, to activate the charm on an individual. Then the Sidereal can start discussion about an innocuous topic, like the weather or gardening. The target of the charm will understand the Sidereal\u2019s words as a metaphor for a topic of the Sidereal\u2019s choice.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Alternate Destiny Accommodation</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>10 Motes, 1 WP<b> Mins:</b> Ride 4, Essence 3; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Indefinite<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> It is not easy for even a Sidereal to be in two places at once. This charm allows a Sidereal to loan one of her inactive Resplendent Destinies to another Sidereal. The Sidereal with the loaned destiny can don the destiny only in the presence of an individual, social group, or location as defined by the destiny's owner. The recipient of the Destiny is unable to use any of its resplendency powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T14:41:37-07:00","id":856020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=855991#post855991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hope no one minds if I turn this into my personal &quot;Sidereal Charms&quot; thread. This Asshole Sidereal charm is great for when you need a patsy.<br /> <br /> <b>Fox Goes to Ground</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>5 Motes, 1 WP;<b> Mins:</b> Thrown 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>Psyche<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Until the last star fades from the morning sky<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> The Sidereal pricks herself and smears her blood somewhere on the target's skin*. The Sidereal's current Resplendent Destiny is thrown over the target and the target is filled with terror and will flee until the Stars disappear the next morning or the target is caught or killed. If detained and questioned, the target says nothing except gibbering mutters of fear. As the last star fades from the sky, the Resplendent Destiny will revert back to the Sidereal's control. The target remembers nothing of the past day except vague feelings of terror. Death of the target will end the Sidereal's Resplendent Destiny.<br /> <br /> *maybe make this a ranged effect? Drop blood on your thrown weapon like Pain-Amplification Stratagem?</div> </div> </div> </div>What do other people remember of the target? Will the guards who locked up the target wake up to find a person reported missing in their cell with no trace of the Destiny identity, or does the target's identity just cease to exist for a while and no one notices their absence?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T14:45:55-07:00","id":856023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=856020#post856020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What do other people remember of the target? Will the guards who locked up the target wake up to find a person reported missing in their cell with no trace of the Destiny identity, or does the target's identity just cease to exist for a while and no one notices their absence?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Good questions! I'm going to say they wake up to find a person reported missing in the cell. Maybe need to add a paradox cost to the charm? Or maybe use of this charm completely ends the Resplendent Destiny? Thus arcane fate would take care of any weird details. &quot;I guess this guy looks a little like the one who assassinated the Governor.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-30-2016, 05:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T09:08:25-07:00","id":865970,"title":"","content":"I almost put this one in Larceny, but all the funky movement of objects charms are in Craft. This charm is good for when you don't want to get caught with an item on your person. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Mischievous Scene Adjustment</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>3 Motes; <b>Mins:</b> Craft 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> A Sidereal can switch locations of an object on her person with another object she carries either on her or within line of sight. Second use of this charm will allow the Sidereal to recover the target object. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T10:18:46-07:00","id":865995,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that looks like Craft to me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T21:25:31-07:00","id":866249,"title":"","content":"I love the idea of Sidereals having a <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/TheLittleShopThatWasntThereYesterday\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Little Shop that Wasn't There&quot; </a>charm. They should totally sell plot coupons and macguffins.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T08:26:32-07:00","id":877718,"title":"","content":"Another day... Another charm... Not sure if this one would go into Craft (for being object oriented) or Awareness (for tracking). I chose Awareness because the Sidereal didn't make the object.<br /> <br /> <b>The Beggar's Coin</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>3 Motes;<b> Mins:</b> Awareness 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> Using an object given or sold (but not stolen) by the target the Sidereal can locate the target though this object. The Sidereal must concentration on the object in their hands. An image of the target's location appears to the Sidereal. The Sidereal can then follow the fate thread between object and the target to his location. Should the Sidereal lose or give the object to someone else, the connection to the target is broken.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-29-2016, 11:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T08:34:41-07:00","id":877726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=854824#post854824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been reading though the Maiden Scriptures and now I am reconsidering what ability this charm matches. The Scripture of the Savory Maiden (Larceny) seems to fit better since it talks about serving the world. I also doubt the Sidereal acquired the location, supplies, and resources to start the business via legal means.<br /> <br /> <b>Pho Cart Methodology</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>5 Motes, 1 WP;<b> Mins:</b> Bureaucracy 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Seven Days<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> The Sidereal can set up a small established business in a town. This Business will neither make or lose money. Residents will patron the business as if it was always there. At the end of the charm's duration, the business will vanish and the town's inhabitants will not remember its existence.<br /> <br /> <b>Essence 4+</b>: The duration of the business is extended to the end of the current story line.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &lt;.&lt;<br /> <br /> &gt;.&gt;<br /> <br /> *steals*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T08:46:07-07:00","id":877737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=877726#post877726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> &lt;.&lt;<br /> <br /> &gt;.&gt;<br /> <br /> *steals*</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <b>Charm Stealing Prana</b><br /> <b>Cost:</b> 5 Minutes; <b>Min:</b> Linguistics 1, Essence 1<br /> <b>Type: </b>Simple<br /> <b>Duration:</b> As long as the internet exists<br /> A Sidereal Charm Maker can find inspiration anywhere, even in another forum poster's charms. The Charm Maker must highlight the charm with their mouse and either Right-Click or use CTRL-V to steal the charm. The Charm Maker can then paste the charm in any document they choose. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T09:05:49-07:00","id":877762,"title":"","content":"Cleaned up Fox Goes to Ground. Fixed the issue <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1144_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1144\" data-vbnamecard=\"1144\">Exthalion</a> brought up, I hope. <br /> <br /> <b>Fox Goes to Ground</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>5 Motes, 1 WP;<b> Mins:</b> Thrown 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>Psyche<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Until the last star fades from the morning sky<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> The Sidereal pricks herself and draws forth a throwing needle made from their blood. The Sidereal attaches the fate thread of her current Resplendent Destiny to the blood needle and throws it at the target. The target is filled with terror and will flee until the Stars disappear the next morning or the target is killed or detained. The target remembers nothing of his time under the charm's influence except vague feelings of terror. As the last star fades from the sky, the Resplendent Destiny will revert back to the Sidereal's control. <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T11:11:11-07:00","id":877906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=877718#post877718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another day... Another charm... Not sure if this one would go into Craft (for being object oriented) or Awareness (for tracking). I chose Awareness because the Sidereal didn't make the object.<br /> <br /> <b>The Beggar's Coin</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>3 Motes;<b> Mins:</b> Awareness 3, Essence 2; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration:</b> Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> Using an object given or sold (but not stolen) by the target the Sidereal can locate the target though this object. The Sidereal must concentration on the object in their hands. An image of the target's location appears to the Sidereal. The Sidereal can then follow the fate thread between object and the target to his location. Should the Sidereal lose or give the object to someone else, the connection to the target is broken.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't say craft. Other abilities deal with things too, but craft deals with the fate of things. This charm uses the thing as a connection to another, but not it's own fate.<br /> <br /> It doesn't really feel like Awareness. Awareness feels more like direct observation of fate. From preternatural senses to querying fate to tracking via the ripples another makes in fate.<br /> <br /> This charm's use of an object feels more like investigation to me. I don't have my books on my right now so I'll have to get back to you on exactly why. But it does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/11I0xCPgAS3ZhxGvTlBoePOuaDqgpyWs13jVKhJ4c8hM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Book of the Emerald Circle</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/37100-white-elephant-for-flintlock-sidereal-custom-charms-and-discussion-on-themes\" target=\"_blank\">Custom Sidereal Charms</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sQxyi3ox0qn53c_vsUaVQi_pRdpKlQE50NT5ldQmxYI/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Expanded Sidereal Linguistics</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/263-limited-reagent","name":"Limited Reagent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar263_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T12:07:19-07:00","id":882071,"title":"","content":"Pho Cart Methodology looks very useful, for a character to have. There are so many ways you can use or abuse the trust and ease and familiarity of &quot;regular&quot; customers and employees that you can't get by actually starting a real business. Also sometimes saving time is a matter of strategy or desperation!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-10T09:28:09-07:00","id":887245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/854627-which-ability-to-put-these-sidereal-charms?p=882071#post882071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pho Cart Methodology looks very useful, for a character to have. There are so many ways you can use or abuse the trust and ease and familiarity of &quot;regular&quot; customers and employees that you can't get by actually starting a real business. Also sometimes saving time is a matter of strategy or desperation!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I've considered adding the ability to give a community a minor intimacy towards the business.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Inspired by Wastevens Performance charms, I came up with one of my own. Not sure if I am going to keep the name or where to put the charm in the Performance tree. It also needs some better mechanics.<br /> <br /> <b>Kiss the Girl</b><br /> <b>Cost: </b>10 Motes;<b> Mins:</b> Performance 5, Essence 3; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords:</b><br /> <b>Duration:</b> Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms: </b>None<br /> <br /> As a conductor leading an orchestra, the Sidereal can conduct the environment to inspire a specific emotion. Fireflies will glow to ignite a couple's love. Thunder will boom to send a warrior's blood thirsting for battle. Anyone within Essence x 10 yards of the Sidereal Performing will get Essence bonus dice for instilling a new intimacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-18T13:49:49-07:00","id":989516,"title":"","content":"<b>Calling the </b><b>Prairie D</b><b>ogs</b><br /> <b>Cost:</b> 5 Motes; <b>Mins:</b> Bureaucracy 2, Essence 1; <b>Type:</b> Simple<br /> <b>Keywords:</b><br /> <b>Duration:</b> Instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b> None<br /> <br /> A Sidereal can call attention to a member of an organization, either ranting about their inefficiency or praising their ingenuity. During her rant, the Sidereal can roll Bureaucracy to instill a minor intimacy relating to the organization. Ever other member of the organization within earshot will gain the minor intimacy as well and also neglect their work to see what is going on. Some will poke their head out of their offices while others will hide behind the corner to eavesdrop. Clever Sidereals use this charm to distract the organization from some other nefarious deed. The Sidereal does not have to be a member of the organization to use this charm.<br /> <br /> ((<a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-qxe9kAvslMk/T1z4nrTK7YI/AAAAAAAABRc/QWu0GG3VvqY/s1600/Dilbert_prairie_dog28657.strip.gif\" target=\"_blank\">Inspire by life in a corporate cubical.</a>))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 10-18-2016, 04:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}